TAGS:   abyss_exit unrand transparent
MONS:   large abomination / thrashing horror / tentacled starspawn \
        / starcursed mass / tentacled monstrosity
MONS:   orange crystal statue
NSUBST: E = E / -
NSUBST: - = 2=0 / 1 / 2=01.. / .
